        "original_id": "79d85eef-7ab3-591e-a2cf-5cf9a08abe90",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Shayang County, Mengzhou, Maliang Town, Jingmen City, Hubei Province, Henan Province, Kaifeng\n- Historical entities: Quan, State of Chu\n- People: Quan Wending, Liu Xiwu\n\nFacts:\n- Quan was founded by Quan Wending, a son of Wen Ding, in the area of modern Maliang Town in Shayang County, Jingmen City, Hubei Province.\n- Quan was founded next to the area where the State of Chu later emerged.\n- Shayang is a county in west-central Hubei Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Mengzhou is a county-level city in Henan Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Liu Xiwu was born in Meng County, Henan Province, which is modern Mengzhou in Jiaozuo, Henan Province.\n- Liu Xiwu was educated in Kaifeng.",
